// @sequence, @cycle, @once, and an alternative that is a block of its own.

== snap.variations
@sequence
    - mira: First.
    - mira: Second.
        @set $count += 1
    -
        mira: Third, in a block.
        @jump snap.variations
@cycle
    - rex: A.
    - rex: B.
@once
    mira: Only once.
    @end
